<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Folder Style Documentation</title>

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        background: #e5e5e5;
    }

    /* Folder (sidebar) */
    #navbar {
        width: 250px;
        background: #f7f3d6; /* soft yellow folder color */
        border-right: 3px solid #c9b87a;
        padding: 20px;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        box-shadow: 4px 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    #navbar header {
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #7b6615;
    }

    .nav-link {
        display: block;
        padding: 10px;
        margin: 8px 0;
        background: #fffef5;
        border: 1px solid #d6c88f;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #5a4d1a;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
        background: #f2eac1;
    }

    /* Document area */
    #main-doc {
        margin-left: 270px;
        padding: 30px;
        width: calc(100% - 270px);
    }

    .main-section {
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .main-section header {
        font-size: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    code {
        display: block;
        background: #f4f4f4;
        padding: 10px;
        border-left: 4px solid #c9b87a;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }

    /* Media query requirement */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        #navbar {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            border-right: none;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #c9b87a;
        }
        #main-doc {
            margin-left: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Folder Navigation -->
<nav id="navbar">
    <header>📁 Folder</header>
    <a href="#Introduction" class="nav-link">Introduction</a>
    <a href="#Setup" class="nav-link">Setup</a>
    <a href="#Usage" class="nav-link">Usage</a>
    <a href="#API_Reference" class="nav-link">API Reference</a>
    <a href="#Examples" class="nav-link">Examples</a>
</nav>

<!-- Document Pages -->
<main id="main-doc">

    <section class="main-section" id="Introduction">
        <header>Introduction</header>
        <p>This is the introduction document in the folder.</p>
        <p>It explains the purpose of the project.</p>
        <code>console.log("Hello World");</code>
        <ul>
            <li>Overview</li>
            <li>Goals</li>
            <li>Audience</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="main-section" id="Setup">
        <header>Setup</header>
        <p>This document describes how to install the project.</p>
        <p>Ensure you have Node.js installed.</p>
        <code>npm install my_library</code>
        <ul>
            <li>Install Node</li>
            <li>Install dependencies</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="main-section" id="Usage">
        <header>Usage</header>
        <p>This document explains how to use the library.</p>
        <p>Import it into your project and begin using features.</p>
        <code>import { feature } from "my_library";</code>
        <ul>
            <li>Basic usage</li>
            <li>Common functions</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="main-section" id="API_Reference">
        <header>API Reference</header>
        <p>Technical details are found here.</p>
        <p>Each function is documented with examples.</p>
        <code>feature(param)</code>
        <ul>
            <li>Function list</li>
            <li>Parameters</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="main-section" id="Examples">
        <header>Examples</header>
        <p>This document contains example code usage.</p>
        <p>You can copy & paste these into your project.</p>
        <code>feature("demo");</code>
        <ul>
            <li>Beginner examples</li>
            <li>Advanced examples</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

</main>

</body>
</html>
